  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The submitted documents together with internal consultee responses are considered to provide sufficient and corroborated evidence which demonstrates that, on the balance of probability, no. 354a Winchelsea Road has been occupied as a single-family dwellinghouse (use class C3) for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date the application was submitted and before 25th April 2024. For this reason the development would be lawful within the provisions of Section 191 of the Town &amp;amp; Country Planning Act 1990 as amended by Section 10 of the Planning and Compensation Act 1991.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
